      "eye_sucker_chemoreceptor_cells_in_octo": "Eye-sucker chemoreceptor cells in octopuses detect HYDROPHOBIC molecules. Van Giesen 2020 (Cell) resolved the molecular structure, opening new biomimetic sensor design.",
