      "b3d_call_next_case": "Another scenario →",
      "b3d_call_p": "The other tabs each teach one piece. Here you have to put them together the way a real call makes you — assess, choose a technique for the person in front of you, place your hands, and adapt when an AED turns up.",
      "b3d_call_step": "Step ",
