      "often_clear_or_nearly_so_fine_if_you_h": "Often clear or nearly so. Fine if you have not been pushing fluids; overdrinking water has its own risks.",
      "omega_3_depression_iron_adhd_style_fat": "Omega-3 + depression, iron + ADHD-style fatigue, sugar crashes, caffeine + adolescent anxiety, gut-brain axis. Contributing factors, not cures.",
      "omega_3_fatty_acids_and_depression": "Omega-3 fatty acids and depression",
      "on_the_helpline": "On the helpline: ",
      "on_tiktok_long_press_a_video_not_inter": "On TikTok, long-press a video → \"Not interested.\" On Instagram, three-dot menu → \"Not interested.\" On YouTube, three-dot menu → \"Don't recommend channel.\" Each tap retrains the algorithm. After a few days the feed shifts.",
      "online_content_red_flags": "Online content red flags",
      "open_questions_no_answer_key": "Open questions (no answer key)",
      "or_possibly_a_sign_of_something_else_m": "Or possibly a sign of something else (medication, liver, blood in urine). If you cannot rehydrate or it persists, see a clinician.",
