      "discussion_modern_internships_and_trad": "Discussion: Modern internships and trade apprenticeships still inherit pieces of this structure — the term-of-service, the credential at the end, the implicit \"no moonlighting.\" What stays the same; what has changed; what should change?",
      "documents_the_information_overload_arg": "Documents the information-overload arguments from 1500-1700.",
