      "tarleton_gillespie_custodians_of_the_i": "Tarleton Gillespie, Custodians of the Internet (2018)",
      "tarot_cards_as_printed_objects_viscont": "Tarot cards as printed objects — Visconti decks → Rider-Waite (1909) → modern indie decks. Major printed-card subculture.",
      "tarot_oracle_decks": "Tarot + Oracle Decks",
