      "ngss_cte_standards": "NGSS / CTE Standards",
      "no_college_debt_aws_quals_already_in_p": "No college debt. AWS quals already in pocket.",
      "no_electric_arc_much_less_uv_visible_f": "No electric arc — much less UV; visible flame is what you're protecting against.",
      "no_electrode_torch_combines_oxygen_ace": "No electrode — torch combines oxygen + acetylene. Filler rod separate (RG45 for steel, similar to ER70S series).",
      "no_matches_try_different_answers": "No matches — try different answers.",
      "no_process_is_best_each_one_is_best_fo": "No process is \"best\" — each one is best for some jobs. Hiring managers test exactly this: \"I need to weld 16-gauge stainless for a food-service line. What process and why?\" If you can answer questions like that, you know welding.",
      "noise_exposure_hearing_loss_silent_car": "🔊 Noise exposure + hearing loss — silent career-killer",
