      "structural_plate_1_16_length_pipe_cuts": "Structural plate ±1/16\" length. Pipe cuts ±1/32\". Precision fab ±0.020\". Aerospace ±0.005\".",
      "stud_welding": "Stud Welding",
      "subsea_pipeline_welder": "Subsea pipeline welder",
