      "eva_clip": "Clip tether ",
      "eva_help": "An ammonia pump on the truss has failed. Translate hand-over-hand from the Quest airlock to the worksite and torque 4 bolts — while respecting the real rule that keeps astronauts alive: at least one tether clipped AT ALL TIMES. Clip the free tether ahead, then move. Every action costs suit consumables.",
